{"3093160": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "INTERSCAPE", "steam_appid": 3093160, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>&lt;Dream Swallowed Reality&gt;</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The 'Oracle', a dream machine from BlueDot, allowed humanity to live out any dream they desired. However, one day a colossal black sphere appeared in the sky, turning humanity's dream into an inescapable nightmare. Now, people are trapped in a prison called 'dream', unable to awaken to reality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Agent K, who possesses the ability to enter the dreams of others, resolves to plunge directly into the dangerous labyrinth of dreams.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093160/extras/7d762a32103da15dd60a04dbded2e28e.poster.avif?t=1786774983\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093160/extras/7d762a32103da15dd60a04dbded2e28e.webm?t=1786774983\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093160/extras/7d762a32103da15dd60a04dbded2e28e.mp4?t=1786774983\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&lt;INTERSCAPE&gt; is a <strong>story-driven action adventure</strong> with standout cinematic direction, offering a unique experience exploring the boundary between dream and reality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>&lt;Every Dream, A New Ability&gt;</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Each dream is an independent world</strong> spun from the subconscious of its owner, and <strong>holds a new ability</strong> for you to wield. Snap your fingers to cross between two dreams, and control the flow of time to challenge seemingly impossible puzzles. Sometimes, you must transform into a non-human entity to discover pieces of the truth no one has ever seen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093160/extras/139d551d90cd150a4fd683620ee7d33d.poster.avif?t=1786774983\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093160/extras/139d551d90cd150a4fd683620ee7d33d.webm?t=1786774983\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093160/extras/139d551d90cd150a4fd683620ee7d33d.mp4?t=1786774983\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>&lt;Save a Slumbering World&gt;</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the fate of a humanity trapped by the mysterious black sphere and the unending dream. One thing is clear: if they don't wake up, extinction is inevitable. Explore the chaotically tangled dreams to find the final secret that will save the slumbering populace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093160/extras/c5c94dad94644fd919652585d3b7f762.poster.avif?t=1786774983\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093160/extras/c5c94dad94644fd919652585d3b7f762.webm?t=1786774983\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093160/extras/c5c94dad94644fd919652585d3b7f762.mp4?t=1786774983\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>&lt;A World of Dreams&gt;</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wander through beautiful landscapes and explore a captivating surreal world. But behind the beauty, danger and nightmares are always lurking. You must carve a path through the tangled fragments of dreams and press on toward the exit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093160/extras/38bdbf266a1cca45c77317da3465241a.poster.avif?t=1786774983\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093160/extras/38bdbf266a1cca45c77317da3465241a.webm?t=1786774983\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093160/extras/38bdbf266a1cca45c77317da3465241a.mp4?t=1786774983\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience INTERSCAPE's original story, stunning visuals, and emotional soundtrack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093160/extras/dbb7caaf833f95c99913ba1b2281de3f.poster.avif?t=1786774983\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093160/extras/dbb7caaf833f95c99913ba1b2281de3f.webm?t=1786774983\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093160/extras/dbb7caaf833f95c99913ba1b2281de3f.mp4?t=1786774983\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>&lt;Dream Swallowed Reality&gt;</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The 'Oracle', a dream machine from BlueDot, allowed humanity to live out any dream they desired. However, one day a colossal black sphere appeared in the sky, turning humanity's dream into an inescapable nightmare. Now, people are trapped in a prison called 'dream', unable to awaken to reality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Agent K, who possesses the ability to enter the dreams of others, resolves to plunge directly into the dangerous labyrinth of dreams.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093160/extras/7d762a32103da15dd60a04dbded2e28e.poster.avif?t=1786774983\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093160/extras/7d762a32103da15dd60a04dbded2e28e.webm?t=1786774983\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093160/extras/7d762a32103da15dd60a04dbded2e28e.mp4?t=1786774983\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&lt;INTERSCAPE&gt; is a <strong>story-driven action adventure</strong> with standout cinematic direction, offering a unique experience exploring the boundary between dream and reality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>&lt;Every Dream, A New Ability&gt;</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Each dream is an independent world</strong> spun from the subconscious of its owner, and <strong>holds a new ability</strong> for you to wield. Snap your fingers to cross between two dreams, and control the flow of time to challenge seemingly impossible puzzles. Sometimes, you must transform into a non-human entity to discover pieces of the truth no one has ever seen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093160/extras/139d551d90cd150a4fd683620ee7d33d.poster.avif?t=1786774983\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093160/extras/139d551d90cd150a4fd683